  "sop_text": "# Sauce Co-Packer \u2014 Shop Floor SOP (synthetic; week 34)\n\n## 2. Shifts\nThe plant runs two shifts: day 06:00-22:00 and night 22:00-06:00.\n\n## 2.1 Maintenance\nFiller-2 is unavailable for scheduled maintenance every Tuesday 02:00-06:00.\n\n## 3. Order priority\nAll confirmed orders are expected to ship on or before their due date.\nPriority-1 orders take precedence and may be expedited even if this causes lower-priority orders to ship late.\n\n## 4. Sanitation\nWhen a line switches from an allergen product to any non-allergen product, a full 90-minute sanitation cleanout is required before the next product runs.\n\n## 6. Sanitation crew\nCleanouts may only be performed during the day shift; the sanitation crew does not work nights.\n",
